  "Id": 1658,
  "Title": "Dr Shamsh Kassim-Lakha awarded Hilal-e-Imtiaz",
  "NewsSubTitle": null,
  "NewsSummary": "AKU's founding president has been honoured with Pakistan's second highest civilian award.",
  "GlobalNews": false,
  "AlternateNewsTitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSubtitle": null,
  "AlternateNewsSummary": null,
  "NewsContent": "<p>The President of Pakistan, General Pervez Musharraf, has honoured Dr Shamsh Kassim-Lakha, with the Hilal-i-Imtiaz at an investiture ceremony in Islamabad in March 2003. </p><p>Dr Kassim-Lakha has previously been awarded the Sitara-i-Imtiaz in recognition of his sustained and eminent services in the fields of education and healthcare.</p>",
